<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-10-12T07:34:09.383Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 07:34:09 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant attacks continue across the Sahel, with bandits raiding two Niger communities, killing scores, and burning houses in Borgu LGA, while suspected herdsmen killed six in Benue and abducted others. The Nigerian government faces US indictment for alleged complicity in child soldier recruitment and baby factories, and an Ijaw traditional ruler died at 64 from reported liposuction complications. Russian forces retook Kidal in Mali and Mali announced a recapture of the city without fighting, indicating renewed external military involvement, and Niger expelled French intelligence agents, heightening diplomatic tension. The conflict produced 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxQNm52LUpzM3lIbkZoZ19nako3elM0NWgxTE9RSG1lZGQyRURvU2s1alRaX2EwRjFEYkRac2JlNDdHcE1KdFN0aVBoMFMtcnBaZXRRM3kzLU1JWS1EUHU1YmVuVk13b0NZdm5NTkpzRzVGalNLRjBBRzJmLWVaT252MkNJTFpyVnhzTlhnd0Zfb1VhVTZXTGZlakt1VkY2RVdnZVB0VmdrSGV4ZjFhQnVjd2VhbEthY2hx?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxNakE3OGN0MnZyVXc4TzB3azJNSHN4bFlGZi1zLVBZNnhpN1lDQlhRRU9SdEFEMTJrX3R6M2NNTnJ4OWRhM1Z2WkZtNkJjdzlpVHJoWURKMEtpOHJhN2lySzRvY3NCS1dRRTZRcFlFNjU4ODdZbDVTRml1Ymk0a3NzdTNfWE5Nb0VqQWZrelpyRmFfZlVValAzSGswaUk2QzBFOEVNM21sMWhpSmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxNRUtIWld5N3BET19pMlNadlkyRjc0MWlOVWk5MVg4WXNxdFFFYVVGSGZCT2RFRkFqdWppa0JualdldnR1R3Z4bGxqVDJ2MXgxeWktT3hPdHQ5cm0zSVhBWEEweF8yZkNaVkZYcTQ4bkUyZWdBRi1BNWlKTDRyd0pQMGM0ZUJxV0N1SEdXZ3UyTGdyTktvRkdDcE13?oc=5&quot;&gt;THISDAYLIVE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Vanguard News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxQ